<doc id="37336" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=37336" title="Siklus ménstruasi">
Siklus ménstruasi

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Siklus ménstruasi, di bawah kontrol of the &lt;a href="endocrine%20system"&gt;endocrine system&lt;/a&gt;, is necessary for &lt;a href="reproduction"&gt;reproduction&lt;/a&gt;. It is commonly divided into three phases: the &lt;a href="follicular%20phase"&gt;follicular phase&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ovulation"&gt;ovulation&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href="luteal%20phase"&gt;luteal phase&lt;/a&gt;; although some sources use a different set of phases: &lt;a href="menstruation"&gt;menstruation&lt;/a&gt;, proliferative phase, and secretory phase. Menstrual cycles are counted from the first day of menstrual bleeding. &lt;a href="Hormonal%20contraception"&gt;Hormonal contraception&lt;/a&gt; interferes with the normal hormonal changes with the aim of preventing reproduction.
