<doc id="37395" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=37395" title="Propinsi Nuristan">
Propinsi Nuristan

Artikel ieu ngeunaan hiji propinsi di Apganistan. Nuristan ogé mangrupa ngaran nu diajukeun pikeun Propinsi &lt;a href="ngaran%20Khyber-Pakhtunkhwa"&gt;Khyber-Pakhtunkhwa&lt;/a&gt; di Pakistan.
Nuristān (&lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A9rsia"&gt;Basa Pérsia&lt;/a&gt;:نورستان), ogé diéjah Nurestān atanapi Nooristan, nyaéta hiji &lt;a href="propinsi%20di%20Apganistan"&gt;propinsi di Apganistan&lt;/a&gt;. Puseur administratifna nyaéta &lt;a href="Parun%2C%20Apganistan"&gt;Parun&lt;/a&gt;. Baheulana, wewengkon ieu kawanoh salaku "&lt;a href="Kafiristan"&gt;Kafiristan&lt;/a&gt;" ("lemahna nu teu percaya [kafir]") nepi ka pangeusina ngagem &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt; dina 1896, sarta teras ku kituna jadi kawanoh salaku "Nuristan" ("Lemah Cahya").
<h2>Dina budaya populér</h2>
<ul>
<li>Nuristan mangrupa subjék buku A Short Walk in the Hindu Kush beunangna &lt;a href="Eric%20Newby"&gt;Eric Newby&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Nuristan mangrupa lokasi 3 misi dina &lt;a href="Hitman%20%28s%C3%A9ri%20kaulinan%20komputer%29"&gt;Hitman&lt;/a&gt; 2: Silent Assassin.</li>
<li>Carita pondok &lt;a href="Rudyard%20Kipling"&gt;Rudyard Kipling&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Man%20Who%20Would%20Be%20King"&gt;The Man Who Would Be King&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="The%20Man%20Who%20Would%20Be%20King%20%28pilem%29"&gt;pilemna&lt;/a&gt; kainspirasi ku Nuristan jeung boga latar dina Nuristan pra-Islam.</li>
</ul>
