Pajangjian Turkmenchay

Pajangjian Turkmenchay (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Basa Rusia&lt;/a&gt;:, &lt;a href="basa%20P%C3%A9rsia"&gt;basa Pérsia&lt;/a&gt;:) nyaéta hiji &lt;a href="pajangjian"&gt;pajangjian&lt;/a&gt; nu dirundingkeun di &lt;a href="Turkmenchay"&gt;Turkmenchay&lt;/a&gt; nu nyieunan &lt;a href="Dinasti%20Qajar"&gt;Dinasti Qajar&lt;/a&gt; (ayeuna &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt;) ngakuan kakawasaan &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt; kana &lt;a href="Kakhanan%20Erivan"&gt;Kakhanan Erivan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kakhanan%20Nakhchivan"&gt;Kakhanan Nakhchivan&lt;/a&gt;, sarta sésa &lt;a href="Kakhanan%20Talysh"&gt;Kakhanan Talysh&lt;/a&gt;, nyieun &lt;a href="Walungan%20Aras"&gt;Walungan Aras&lt;/a&gt; minangka watesna, saméméh éléhna Qajar dina &lt;a href="1828"&gt;1828&lt;/a&gt; dina ahir &lt;a href="Perang%20Rusia-P%C3%A9rsia%20%281826%E2%80%931828%29"&gt;Perang Rusia-Pérsia 1826-1828&lt;/a&gt;.
Pajangjian ieu ditandatanganan dina 21 Pébruari 1828 ku &lt;a href="Abbas%20Mirza"&gt;Abbas Mirza&lt;/a&gt;, putra mahkota, sareng Allah-Yar Khan Asaf al-Daula, kanselir &lt;a href="Fath%20Ali%20Shah"&gt;Fath Ali Shah&lt;/a&gt; ti pihak Pérsia, sarta Jéndral &lt;a href="Ivan%20Paskievich"&gt;Ivan Paskievich&lt;/a&gt; minangka wakil pihak &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Rusia"&gt;Kakaisaran Rusia&lt;/a&gt;.
